sequenceDiagram
  participant Visitor as Visitor browser
  participant FilterPanel as FilterPanel (IC-9)
  participant CatalogState as CatalogState
  participant CatalogGrid as CatalogGrid (IC-9)
  participant Comparison as ComparisonDrawer (IC-10)
  participant Analytics as GA4

  Visitor->>FilterPanel: Select "frame: High tensile steel"
  FilterPanel->>CatalogState: Update query params + memoized filters
  CatalogState->>CatalogGrid: Provide filtered models
  CatalogGrid-->>Visitor: Render updated cards with badges
  FilterPanel->>Analytics: Emit catalog_filter_applied(filter_id, values, results_count)
  Visitor->>CatalogGrid: Click "Compare" on model A
  CatalogGrid->>Comparison: Add model A
  Comparison->>Analytics: Emit catalog_compare_opened with [modelA]
  Visitor->>CatalogGrid: Click "Compare" on model B
  CatalogGrid->>Comparison: Add model B
  Comparison->>Analytics: Emit catalog_compare_opened with [modelA, modelB]
